# Global UX Feedback Standard

## Always

### On initial data load
- Show **Skeleton** (preferred) or **Spin** until data is ready.
- Do not show blank content or plain "Загрузка..." text without visual indicator.
- Dev: min duration 250–350ms so Skeleton is visible when request is fast.

### On async operations (loading)
- Show AntD `message.loading` with key; resolve with `hideLoading()`.
- Use `showLoading`, `hideLoading` from `src/shared/lib/feedback.ts`.

### On mutations (save/create/update/delete)
- Show **notification.success** on 2xx (survives redirect; duration 4s).
- **Success notification must include entity identifier when available** (e.g. "Контрагент создан" + "ООО Рога и копыта"; "Договор создан" + "CN-T24-NEW"; "Контрагент удалён" + ctrName).
- Show **notification.error** on non-2xx; include error code or user-friendly text.
- Use `notifySuccess`, `notifyError`, `setFlashSuccess` from `src/shared/lib/feedback.ts`.
- Before redirect: `setFlashSuccess(title, description)` so notification appears on target page; do not duplicate.
- **Never leave the user without feedback after clicking Save.**

### Code
- Do not remove existing acceptance validations; UX feedback is additive.
- Use `src/shared/lib/api.ts` `fetchWithErrorHandling` for normalized error handling.
- Use `src/shared/ui/ScreenLoader` for loading states.

### Reporting
- Every task must add/update a TASK section in `docs/AGENT_TASK_REPORTS.md` (task id, agent, what done, artifacts).
